{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/a858f92c9fc70a1ce29ac876db3c47b2.poster.avif?t=1756661698\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/a858f92c9fc70a1ce29ac876db3c47b2.webm?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/a858f92c9fc70a1ce29ac876db3c47b2.mp4?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Up \u2013 Build your way to the top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tower Up</i> is a physics based building game where your goal is simple: <strong>reach the top</strong>. Place blocks carefully, balance unstable shapes, and climb higher and higher without everything falling apart beneath you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\uddf1 How it works:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based block placement</strong>,\u00a0No snapping, no grids. Just you, gravity, and your sense of balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal\u00a0</strong>- Reach the top\u00a0 using only your skill and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0Difficulty Modes:</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>\u00a0- Build with <strong>checkpoints</strong> to save your progress along the way. You don\u2019t have to worry too much, just enjoy the climb!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>No checkpoints.</strong> One mistake, and it\u2019s back to the bottom. Only the most skilled survive!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/5e547d9a8a5bc97890311fb0f3f0aaca.poster.avif?t=1756661698\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/5e547d9a8a5bc97890311fb0f3f0aaca.webm?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/5e547d9a8a5bc97890311fb0f3f0aaca.mp4?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb alone Or bring the whole crew along! In Tower up you can easily invite all your friends via steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/6cbdf3c8ae7b75156edf0a6d8e6ff1f3.poster.avif?t=1756661698\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/6cbdf3c8ae7b75156edf0a6d8e6ff1f3.webm?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/6cbdf3c8ae7b75156edf0a6d8e6ff1f3.mp4?t=1756661698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618840?t=1756661698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618840?t=1756661698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/cb6025e1b563cd8d876fbdc68de33cc372f68c7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756661698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/cb6025e1b563cd8d876fbdc68de33cc372f68c7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756661698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player",